{"author":{"id":"337a442880d7106d509ff84f2f7fef51acce8bce88b081d4f4c3f0298b7e7941"},"ops":[{"type":3,"timestamp":1791820591,"nonce":"QWbnyXdKcbVQOvi1bAc0WSwGNXA=","message":"Decision: re-injection uses tabs.query with the ATS url patterns, as the spec says; an ATS iframe on an employer page is NOT re-injected after an extension reload (needs one page reload). Reason: measured in A2 e2e: executeScript allFrames fails with Cannot access contents of the page when the top frame host is not granted, and frame ids would need webNavigation which is forbidden. Orphan self-removal still works for those iframes. Noted in the spec and the help topic.","files":null}]}